---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import personal from '../data/personal.json';

const link =
  'text-csii-ochre underline decoration-csii-gold underline-offset-4 hover:text-csii-brown dark:text-csii-gold dark:hover:text-struct-sand';
const h2Class = 'mt-10 font-serif text-xl font-medium tracking-tight';
const pClass = 'mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed';
const ulClass = 'mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-sm leading-relaxed';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions | Siratee Lertsubthaworn"
  description="Terms & Conditions governing use of sirateelert.github.io, including disclaimers on informational content and AI-assisted material."
>
  <Header />

  <main id="main" class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-14">
    <p class="mb-1 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-csii-ochre dark:text-csii-gold">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">Last updated: 30 September 2026</p>

    <article aria-label="Terms and Conditions">
      <h2 class={h2Class}>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p class={pClass}>
        By accessing or using sirateelert.github.io (the &ldquo;Site&rdquo;), you agree to these Terms &amp;
        Conditions. If you do not agree, please do not use the Site.
      </p>

      <h2 class={h2Class}>2. Purpose and Nature of Content</h2>
      <p class={pClass}>
        The Site is a personal academic and professional portfolio of {personal.fullName}. Content is provided
        for general informational purposes only and may be updated, corrected or removed at any time without
        notice.
      </p>

      <h2 class={h2Class}>3. No Professional or Legal Advice</h2>
      <p class={pClass}>
        Nothing on the Site constitutes professional, financial, engineering or legal advice, and no
        professional, advisory or client relationship is created by your use of the Site or by contacting the
        author. You should obtain advice from a suitably qualified professional before acting on any material
        found here.
      </p>

      <h2 class={h2Class}>4. Generative AI and Experimental Material</h2>
      <p class={pClass}>
        Certain projects, prototypes, code or drafts may have been produced with the assistance of generative AI
        tools. Such material is experimental, generated rapidly, and requires rigorous human verification before
        any production or operational use. It is subject in full to the
        <a href="/#governance" class={link}>Generative AI &amp; Tooling Governance</a> statement, which forms part
        of these Terms.
      </p>

      <h2 class={h2Class}>5. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p class={pClass}>
        Unless otherwise stated, the text, design and original materials on the Site are &copy;
        {new Date().getFullYear()} {personal.fullName}, all rights reserved. Names, marks and logos of third
        parties, including universities, organisations and employers, belong to their respective owners and are
        used for identification only, without implying endorsement.
      </p>

      <h2 class={h2Class}>6. Acceptable Use</h2>
      <p class={pClass}>You agree not to:</p>
      <ul class={ulClass}>
        <li>interfere with, disrupt or attempt unauthorised access to the Site or its hosting infrastructure;</li>
        <li>scrape or reproduce substantial portions of the Site for commercial purposes without permission; or</li>
        <li>use the Site for any unlawful purpose or in a way that infringes the rights of others.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class={h2Class}>7. External Links</h2>
      <p class={pClass}>
        The Site may link to third-party websites. The author does not control and is not responsible for the
        content, availability or privacy practices of those sites.
      </p>

      <h2 class={h2Class}>8. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
      <p class={pClass}>
        To the extent permitted by applicable law, the Site and its content are provided &ldquo;as is&rdquo; and
        &ldquo;as available&rdquo;, without warranties of any kind, express or implied, including accuracy,
        completeness, fitness for a particular purpose and non-infringement.
      </p>

      <h2 class={h2Class}>9. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p class={pClass}>
        To the extent permitted by applicable law, the author shall not be liable for any direct, indirect,
        incidental or consequential loss arising from your use of, or reliance on, the Site or any content on it,
        including AI-assisted material. Nothing in these Terms excludes liability that cannot be excluded under
        applicable law.
      </p>

      <h2 class={h2Class}>10. Governing Law</h2>
      <p class={pClass}>
        These Terms are governed by the laws of the Kingdom of Thailand, and any dispute shall be subject to the
        jurisdiction of the competent courts of Thailand.
      </p>

      <h2 class={h2Class}>11. Changes to These Terms</h2>
      <p class={pClass}>
        These Terms may be revised from time to time. Continued use of the Site after a revision constitutes
        acceptance of the updated Terms. The date of the latest revision appears at the top of this page.
      </p>

      <h2 class={h2Class}>12. Contact</h2>
      <p class={pClass}>
        Questions about these Terms may be sent to
        <a href={`mailto:${personal.email}`} class={link}>{personal.email}</a>. See also the
        <a href="/privacy" class={link}>Privacy Policy</a>.
      </p>
    </article>

    <p class="mt-12 text-sm">
      <a href="/" class={link}>&larr; Return to home page</a>
    </p>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
